p("No se piden Client IDs","The Wii never asks for Client IDs or account passwords.","La Wii ne demande ni Client ID ni mot de passe de compte.","Die Wii fragt nie nach Client-IDs oder Kontopasswörtern.","La Wii non chiede mai Client ID né password dell'account.","De Wii vraagt nooit om Client ID's of accountwachtwoorden.","O Wii nunca pede Client IDs nem senhas de conta.")
